								<div class="forum_topic_name" title="I enjoy the Ace Combat games, 8 is very good, and I loved playing 7 in VR (PSVR 1!). As Ace Combat 8 sadly has I no VR mode, is this worth the high asking price? Or is it too much of a. sim for an Axe Combat player?

